Z||000000||mpicanso||09-14-1999||03:14 PM||||Hello everyone, I am new to this group, as I just found. I just bought an 87GT and the heater core let go and leaked all over the passenger floor. What is the best way to clean this up. Also I was seeing a white color-less smoke coming from the vents when every the A/C or Heat was on, any ideas????||||reg||1
Z||000001||GT Bastard||09-14-1999||05:37 PM||||Hey, I got an 87 too!  It looks like you may have a hard time cleaning the carpets in that thing.... You might wanna try resolve, but if worse comes to worse, just replace the carpets.  ||||reg||11
Z||000002||AL||09-14-1999||08:04 PM||||well to clean the rug try 409 then towel dry it or vacuam it.the smoke may be that your ac is out of freon.||||reg||1
Z||000003||theogre||09-14-1999||08:09 PM||||more likely mist from the blown heater core. was probably leaking a little bit before it poped completely.<P>Your best bet is to pull the carpet out. The antifreeze will leach back to the surface every time it gets damp. Take the carpets out and hose them down about every 2-3 hours for a day or so to work out the glycol. Then let them dry. If you don't get out the antifreeze they will likely always feel sticky no mater what you do.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Bruce||09-14-1999||09:02 PM||||Anyone have a general idea of the carpet reolacement cost? ||||reg||5
Z||000005||Bruce||09-14-1999||09:05 PM||||Replacement||||reg||1
Z||000006||BENGAL4||09-15-1999||12:48 PM||||I just purchased one from The Fiero Store. The cost was $140.00. I installed it and I am not too happy.It looks kind of cheap. Also the carpet is molded to fit but it doesn't fit very well. I made it fit the best I could.  Luckily, I purchased floor mats also and they hide it. I wished I would have bought mine thru Mr. Mikes. I bought some leather seat covers from him and they are great. In his kit you get carpet, floor mats, and new carpet for the door panels. Maybe with some umpire money I will make this fall, I will go ahead and buy Mr. Mikes and tell the Fiero Store to stick it.<p>[This message has been edited by BENGAL4 (edited 09-15-1999).]||||reg||13
Z||000007||RICK||09-15-1999||01:11 PM||||Mr. Mikes has the carpet set for $130.00, If it's anything like the quality of the leather seats then it has to be great.  His web site is  <A HREF="http://www.mrmikes.com" TARGET=_blank>www.mrmikes.com</A> <BR>||||reg||4
